OL,3,A'Trump is still your president,' White
OL,4,AHouse says after Democrats sweep to
OL,5,Aresounding midterms win
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,9,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,FTrump acknowledges the Iran war, and
OL,13,Fthe rising cost of living, were factors
OL,14,Fin his Republican Party's defeat - as
OL,15,Fthe White House posts on social media:
OL,16,F"Trump is still your president"
OL,18,FIn Senate races, Democrats picked up a
OL,19,Fstring of victories in Republican
OL,20,Fstrongholds including Texas, South
OL,21,FCarolina and Kansas - we're yet to hear
OL,22,Fresults in Alaska and Mississippi
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
