OL,3,A'Trump is still your president,' White
OL,4,AHouse says after Democrats sweep to
OL,5,Aresounding midterms win
OL,6,
OL,7,FTop Democrat in the House Hakeem
OL,8,FJeffries calls his party's victory a
OL,9,F"red, white and blue moment". Some
OL,10,Fseats in the lower chamber are still
OL,11,Fbeing counted - but the Democrats have
OL,12,Fsurpassed the 218 needed to win
OL,14,FHow will Trump deal with a Congress
OL,15,Fcontrolled by Democrats? A picture he
OL,16,Fposted on social media may give us a
OL,17,Fclue, writes our White House reporter
